## Session Journal

Maintain a session journal at `docs.vault/10-19 operations/12 session journal/{date}_{session_id}.md` throughout the session. Create the file early and add entries as work progresses — don't wait until the end. To find your session ID, look for the most recently modified `.jsonl` file in `.state/claude/projects/` for this project.

The journal uses this format:

```markdown
---
description: session journal — {date} ({short_id})
session_id: {full_session_id}
date: {YYYY-MM-DD}
branch: {current_branch}
---

## Decisions
- What was decided and why

## Learnings
- What was learned and where/how it came up

## Action Items
- What needs to be done and any relevant context

## Key Exchanges
- One-sentence summary of an exchange and its outcome
```

Omit empty sections.

